    <mxCell id="caption" value="A schematic overview — directional trends drawn from agent-session logs and the project milestones below. Quality of output and autonomy climb into the launch and stay high; cost per feature peaks there, holds until the JSONL handoff — the first cost reduction — steps down through the tiering work, then levels off where the eval bench begins measuring; harness maintainability climbs in steps as maintainability work lands, to sit just under quality of output." style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=9;fontStyle=2;fontColor=#9AA5B1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
